WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.635
Infinite matroids break.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.157
Edmonds' theorem holds for finite matroids. Does

3
00:00:05.157 --> 00:00:07.515
it survive the jump to infinite ones?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.878
Any cover would force an ordinal rank

5
00:00:10.878 --> 00:00:12.956
to drop forever, and that cannot happen.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.515
Claimed: both infinite conjectures fail.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.916
Main theorem in Lean.
